  "notes": [
    "Source names match whole strings exactly; a code such as 1.1 does not match 11.1 or part of a longer name.",
    "Optional icon_id and urn restrict a rule. expected_room describes the reference convention and does not restrict matching.",
    "These defaults describe the supplied reference and Marin's convention. A different project may assign a code to a different room; review or choose the automatic alternative.",
    "Numbered room variants are omitted; the room dictionary handles room numbers separately.",
    "Sensor Mode and Night Mode have different reference translations with identical icon/type selectors across rooms. Their current manual rules preserve the chosen translations.",
    "The reference contains 36.39 for Ogledalo kupaonica 2; Marin also specifies 35.39. Both exact source names are retained.",
    "Only entity display names and translated room labels are included. Project identifiers and credentials are not stored.",
    "Numbered AC, FH, T and S function names are omitted: shared naming rules use Klima, Podno grijanje, Temperatura and Senzor plus the actual associated room. FH also matches without a number.",
    "The supplied R1 apartment block adds confirmed numeric aliases 2.9 (Switch only) and 32.36 (Trigger only). Existing source-name entries are preserved; conflicted or unconfirmed block codes are left to automatic suggestions and manual review.",
    "5.19-20 is labelled Sjenilo boravak after reviewing 11 matching block occurrences: Blind icon 7, Covering function, Living room. This generic HR label is derived from the consistent icon/type/room context, not a directly matched translated reference entity; no facade or window orientation is inferred."
